<block wx:if="{{authorized}}"><view class="page settings-page">
<view class="eyebrow">STORE SETTINGS</view><view class="page-title">店铺设置</view><view class="subtitle">让顾客看到你的店，也感受到你的招呼。</view>
<view class="store-preview"><view class="small">顾客端预览</view><view class="preview-name">{{name || '你的店铺名称'}}</view><view class="preview-welcome">{{welcome || '欢迎光临'}}</view><text class="preview-status">● {{open ? '营业中' : '休息中'}}</text></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-title">门店信息</view><view class="field-label">店铺名称</view><input class="input" data-field="name" maxlength="20" placeholder="请输入店铺名称" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="counter">{{name.length}} / 20</view><view class="field-label">欢迎词</view><textarea class="input textarea" data-field="welcome" maxlength="48" placeholder="例如：三两好友，一桌好味" value="{{welcome}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="counter">{{welcome.length}} / 48</view><view class="divider"/><view class="row between"><view><view class="field-label switch-label">营业接单</view><view class="subtitle">关闭后，顾客仍可浏览菜单，暂不能下单</view></view><switch color="#ba4b2d" checked="{{open}}" bindchange="toggle"/></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="section-title">餐具与餐巾纸收费</view><view class="field-label">餐具单价（元／套）</view><input class="input" type="digit" data-field="cutleryYuan" value="{{cutleryYuan}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="请填写实际单价，免费填0"/><view class="field-label">餐巾纸单价（元／份）</view><input class="input" type="digit" data-field="napkinYuan" value="{{napkinYuan}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="请填写实际单价，免费填0"/><view class="subtitle">顾客开始点餐前选择数量并确认费用，每次用餐只计入一次。已确认的用餐保留确认时单价。</view></view><button class="primary save-settings" bindtap="save">保存店铺设置</button></view></block>
